<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://yamaha-motor.com.vn/xe/janus-phien-ban-gioi-han-hoan-toan-moi-bj7s/">Yamaha Janus</a></p>
</td>
<td style="width: 50%;">
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-34059" src="https://yamaha-motor.com.vn/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Red-Candy-004.png" alt="" width="1296" height="1088" srcset="https://yamaha-motor.com.vn/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Red-Candy-004.png 1296w, https://yamaha-motor.com.vn/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Red-Candy-004-300x252.png 300w, https://yamaha-motor.com.vn/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Red-Candy-004-1024x860.png 1024w, https://yamaha-motor.com.vn/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Red-Candy-004-150x126.png 150w, https://yamaha-motor.com.vn/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Red-Candy-004-768x645.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1296px) 100vw, 1296px" /></p>
